nes PlasmaBFT, Reth/EVM execution, zero-fee USD₮ transfers, seeded stablecoin liquidity, and the Plasma One consumer product.","competitors":[{"name":"Tron","relationship":"USD₮ transfer and emerging-market payment competitor"},{"name":"TON","relationship":"consumer stablecoin and messaging-distribution competitor"},{"name":"payments-focused L1s and Ethereum L2s","relationship":"stablecoin settlement and developer alternatives"}],"narrative_arc":"Plasma used financing, a heavily subscribed token sale, exchange distribution, and $2B announced day-one stablecoin liquidity to launch rapidly; the next phase is proving organic payments rather than launch-capital retention.","media_sentiment":"mixed"},"risk":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","exploits":[],"sanctions":{"flagged":false,"detail":"No chain-level designation is asserted by this dossier; an archived exact-name SDN review remains an explicit publication gap."},"extraction_flags":["team_investor_concentration","stablecoin_dependency","early_liquidity_dependence","validator_decentralization_unknown"],"audit_status":null,"risks":[{"type":"token_concentration","detail":"Team and investor allocations represent 50% of the initial XPL supply and share a multi-year unlock schedule.","source_url":"https://www.plasma.org/zh/company/blog/xpl-the-public-sale-and-its-role-in-the-plasma-ecosystem"},{"type":"validator_decentralization","detail":"The tokenomics made inflation conditional on external validators and delegation, while the current dossier cannot verify whether that transition is complete.","source_url":"https://www.plasma.org/zh/company/blog/xpl-the-public-sale-and-its-role-in-the-plasma-ecosystem"},{"type":"bridge_decentralization","detail":"Plasma documentation says the Bitcoin-bridge verifier network will decentralize over time.","source_url":"https://docs.plasma.to/docs/get-started/why-build-on-plasma/overview"},{"type":"stablecoin_dependency","detail":"The chain and vertically integrated product thesis depend heavily on U